          "ImageDescription": {
            "value": "Looking to south across the <b><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Agua_Hedionda_Lagoon\" title=\"Category:Agua Hedionda Lagoon\">Agua Hedionda Lagoon</a></b>, from near its western end. \n<ul><li>The <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Encina_Power_Station\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Encina Power Station\">Encina Power Station</a> can be seen in the background, and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U.S._Route_101_in_California#History\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:U.S. Route 101 in California\">Historic Route 101</a> on the right.</li>\n<li>Located on the coast in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carlsbad,_California\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Carlsbad, California\">Carlsbad</a>, San Diego County, Southern California.</li></ul>",
